    ('dbbc629a-5052-4c1a-8558-f3f0d6d21e12', 'bantam-easter-egger', 'Bantam Easter Egger', 'Bantam Easter Egger', true, 'Bantams', 'Easter Egger is a mixed-heritage blue-egg-gene type rather than a standardized breed. Unlike a standardized heritage breed, the name identifies a commercial cross, strain, or breeding program selected for a practical production goal. Exact parent lines and performance can change between suppliers or generations, so catalog facts describe the type generally rather than guaranteeing identical birds from every source.

