    ('c0bdbafe-40e7-452b-956b-a5692c57c547', 'moon-dust-blue', 'Moon Dust Blue', 'Moon Dust Blue', true, 'Specialty / Project', 'Moon Dust Blue is a Whiting Farms specialty blue-egg line. Unlike a standardized heritage breed, the name identifies a commercial cross, strain, or breeding program selected for a practical production goal. Exact parent lines and performance can change between suppliers or generations, so catalog facts describe the type generally rather than guaranteeing identical birds from every source.

