    ('0eff76e3-9cc8-4982-aef7-c514d750c96b', 'naked-neck-black', 'Naked Neck - Black', 'Naked Neck', true, 'Dual Purpose', 'Naked Neck chickens originated in southeastern Europe and were developed during centuries ago. They were developed as a naturally bare-necked utility chicken and spread widely through Transylvania and neighboring regions. Their history reflects the practical and cultural priorities of the farmers and breeders who maintained them before modern poultry production narrowed the number of commonly used breeds.

