    ('767137f4-561f-42f8-b597-386c65688de6', 'prairie-bluebell', 'Prairie Bluebell', 'Prairie Bluebell', true, 'Layers', 'Prairie Bluebell is a commercial blue-egg hybrid developed for productive backyard laying. Unlike a standardized heritage breed, the name identifies a commercial cross, strain, or breeding program selected for a practical production goal. Exact parent lines and performance can change between suppliers or generations, so catalog facts describe the type generally rather than guaranteeing identical birds from every source.

