    ('f3af369c-9efa-4f4d-b774-e77b36a54347', 'red-ranger', 'Red Ranger', 'Red Ranger', true, 'Meat Birds', 'Red Ranger chickens were developed through commercial slower-growing colored broiler breeding for range and small-farm systems. The line was selected for steady growth, mobility, and foraging, giving small farms and direct-market producers an alternative suited to its intended production system. Because commercial breeding programs can change, performance should be understood as a researched range rather than a permanent breed standard.

