    ('ba4b8f3e-8147-4de6-a98b-11d4fda42f7e', 'welsummer', 'Welsummer', 'Welsummer', true, 'Layers', 'Welsummer chickens originated in Netherlands and were developed during early twentieth century. They were developed around Welsum from local farm hens and several imported breeds for richly colored eggs. Their history reflects the practical and cultural priorities of the farmers and breeders who maintained them before modern poultry production narrowed the number of commonly used breeds.

