    ('a97b33ec-d4f0-4fc4-a025-4b5d4464cb5b', 'whiting-true-blue', 'Whiting True Blue', 'Whiting True Blue', true, 'Specialty / Project', 'Whiting True Blue is a Whiting Farms line developed by poultry geneticist Tom Whiting for blue eggs. Unlike a standardized heritage breed, the name identifies a commercial cross, strain, or breeding program selected for a practical production goal. Exact parent lines and performance can change between suppliers or generations, so catalog facts describe the type generally rather than guaranteeing identical birds from every source.

